 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_a7c370049abfd68da807",
   "sourceHash": "a7c370049abfd68da807195e308cd961e18b43dcef77094ce2d2f7b4328824c6",
   "text": "Kairali 草本茶植根于古老的阿育吠陀医学，经精心调配，针对多种与健康和活力相关的问题。每种成分都因其调理功效而被精心挑选，因此每一杯都能为您的整体健康提供支持。这款不含咖啡因的草本冲饮，非常适合希望以天然方式排毒、焕活和补充活力的人士。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5a4de750f548ce89d344",
   "sourceHash": "5a4de750f548ce89d344c0f0e0d4d21b89d3306d1732fff97aebec2fb2269c73",
   "text": "汇聚自然上乘草本的强效配方",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_09ac4a2a7e202bc83a31",
   "sourceHash": "09ac4a2a7e202bc83a3191d0880da6fd130381059b746854748cc061387779e5",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀草本茶的奥妙在于其精心挑选的成分，包括：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a74391397a67c8f7586",
   "sourceHash": "2a74391397a67c8f7586ebb22485984e5582a4dc02814f59acf5c0cda2482d54",
   "text": "图尔西（圣罗勒）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_77406474adb0df0f9f68",
   "sourceHash": "77406474adb0df0f9f6872c800c4a5413527cbba11bcf06c165010861b5a121b",
   "text": "：图尔西被誉为“草药女王”，是一种强效的适应原，有助于维护呼吸系统健康、增强免疫力并对抗压力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e8459f063ce80afc96e2",
   "sourceHash": "e8459f063ce80afc96e2e49343e9965fba8508a1c531f8b56bfbb00f795cb785",
   "text": "图尔西（圣罗勒）：图尔西被誉为“草药女王”，是一种强效的适应原，有助于维护呼吸系统健康、增强免疫力并对抗压力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_51f245ab6a3e829a372b",
   "sourceHash": "51f245ab6a3e829a372b44569d937cfd51e617e0faf37a566b26ce5f27c51759",
   "text": "南非醉茄（Ashwagandha）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6959057557abcd48bd50",
   "sourceHash": "6959057557abcd48bd50afeb9fe3f11e95204aadce2eb74dda4ea62743d02c0f",
   "text": "：南非醉茄是一种备受推崇的阿育吠陀草药，因其适应原特性而广受赞誉，有助于减轻压力、提升活力并改善头脑清晰度。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ab3edb0facb3d92989b7",
   "sourceHash": "ab3edb0facb3d92989b7b76a66b1666c553fb5b875597d55c7cbc87dfeabd6b0",
   "text": "南非醉茄（Ashwagandha）：南非醉茄是一种备受推崇的阿育吠陀草药，因其适应原特性而广受赞誉，有助于减轻压力、提升活力并改善头脑清晰度。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_544a9cb451f2a731f20e",
   "sourceHash": "544a9cb451f2a731f20e658e5f6d1547ef51017cd1d4e88f5fdbff73f68300df",
   "text": "生姜",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a6e41cb2a22f8daa9868",
   "sourceHash": "a6e41cb2a22f8daa9868c8383faa9b5f5396aaa823e8e79cf1d0bdcc65d41d0c",
   "text": "：生姜天然具有抗炎和助消化的特性，有助于舒缓肠胃、帮助消化并促进血液循环。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1daddcd918bfdd8a2b03",
   "sourceHash": "1daddcd918bfdd8a2b034ea3fcb562bd2b8d69036f2439afb589677f061b9f1c",
   "text": "生姜：生姜天然具有抗炎和助消化的特性，有助于舒缓肠胃、帮助消化并促进血液循环。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ffa95babefff0ef16f25",
   "sourceHash": "ffa95babefff0ef16f2594b675599e2efb2f61b7e1afcb03594bb279c37389d8",
   "text": "小豆蔻",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de3e370fa683fdcdf72c",
   "sourceHash": "de3e370fa683fdcdf72c984e93d3adddd04d2e451b0b5f4d81311f4bcce00d47",
   "text": "：这种芳香的香料有助于促进消化健康和排毒，同时带来清凉的口感。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_faef367ab9b23ee8ee07",
   "sourceHash": "faef367ab9b23ee8ee079309b2fc128f8c474a3ca3c2eb911df258ae6b7d1e78",
   "text": "小豆蔻：这种芳香的香料有助于促进消化健康和排毒，同时带来清凉的口感。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_992a473d91d42f0a7fda",
   "sourceHash": "992a473d91d42f0a7fda726c89d83d6c343ef01af3ea6e787b7e77a2999ae3d5",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀草本茶的主要益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3806022d2339c98c3e3f",
   "sourceHash": "3806022d2339c98c3e3f4f30022b5c597560dfce9e6a0c7bcdb7f43e1714274f",
   "text": "：这款茶富含抗氧化物，有助于身体排毒，让您感到焕然一新、精力充沛。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8f087475bb44a88f2d52",
   "sourceHash": "8f087475bb44a88f2d525ce442a333d3731171545b332bdab430a025fc091eb2",
   "text": "排毒：这款茶富含抗氧化物，有助于身体排毒，让您感到焕然一新、精力充沛。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a81c0a5379335aec6b1",
   "sourceHash": "2a81c0a5379335aec6b1d1554ae3e4c12dcd9675bbe72339b277c461481942e6",
   "text": "增强免疫力",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_434db2b8376da171fcde",
   "sourceHash": "434db2b8376da171fcde07cbba0976f91dbe6af8e35bd80873b27889165e4932",
   "text": "：南非醉茄与图尔西的强效组合可增强免疫系统，帮助您保持健康、抵御疾病。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'keeps you healthy and resistant to disease' rendered as 'helps you stay healthy and resist illness' to avoid an absolute efficacy claim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d90d1c91218a32f3c926",
   "sourceHash": "d90d1c91218a32f3c9269e30e10749924779854aac7cfc91e8ec9a2afe788732",
   "text": "增强免疫力：南非醉茄与图尔西的强效组合可增强免疫系统，帮助您保持健康、抵御疾病。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'keeps you healthy and resistant to disease' rendered as 'helps you stay healthy and resist illness' to avoid an absolute efficacy claim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9c6063b0a3de56ca6194",
   "sourceHash": "9c6063b0a3de56ca61947d168d4a3ee9b1b282e982d1c94e9c3e440536fc6b5e",
   "text": "缓解压力",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4df3df57623cfc375154",
   "sourceHash": "4df3df57623cfc375154416390664e856aab3638a699539c264f59514c855abf",
   "text": "：南非醉茄与图尔西的适应原特性相辅相成，有助于减轻压力、促进情绪平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8ef1645fde7e661499a",
   "sourceHash": "b8ef1645fde7e661499a0ce096b8ca25feb6b0c3e56fc557cf07e29c4d193033",
   "text": "缓解压力：南非醉茄与图尔西的适应原特性相辅相成，有助于减轻压力、促进情绪平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e0be4b3c2cd16167d432",
   "sourceHash": "e0be4b3c2cd16167d4320f6b1be262d3d58dab19b30193e2adb27ae1ec34b821",
